  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who may be exposed to or share racially charged, hate-filled content, particularly those who might find humor or satisfaction in mocking white supremacist ideologies or perpetuating false historical narratives. The meme is designed to provoke, demean, and insult Black people by leveraging the Ku Klux Klan as a tool for racial insult, thus targeting those who either endorse or are indifferent to such hateful tropes. The audience is likely to include people who engage with internet memes that rely on historical distortion and racial stereotypes for comedic or provocative effect, often without regard for the harm caused to marginalized communities.",
